{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# GameFeature / Experience｜结构图\nGameMode已源码消费Experience／原Session；Teams三Spawn内部及来源资产仍未迁移。\nGate57编译／UHT通过、运行时与Editor DLL已链接；GF正式运行未验，历史Build56见结构文档。\n[[GGYGO_流程_GameFeature.canvas|流程图]] · [[GameFeature/结构|结构文档]] · [[计划_GameFeature|计划]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "experience",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOExperienceDefinition\nGameFeaturesToEnable→根；GameFeatureSources→来源；SquadMembers→默认编队。\nTryBuildGameFeatureInput→成功FInput／定位错误；InitGame与IsDataValid共用。\n成功两空才NoGF；失败拒绝。来源资产未迁移。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "feature",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UE GameFeatures原生权威\nSession→Controller.LoadAndActivateGameFeaturePlugin（自身handle、根URL）。\n原生执行Active需求、状态／引用合并与迁移。\nGameMode只消费Session结果和当前资格，不裸激活。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 250,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "gm",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOGameMode｜原场景消费者\nInitGame→Experience成功输入；两空NoGF。\n非空TryCreate→先保存原Session再Start。\nAreGameFeaturesReady→原身份＋IsReadyFor。\nController局部弱快照；三Spawn内部未迁移。\nDestroyed／EndPlay→CloseGameFeatureSession：\n移出原Session后Close、先于Super；GI Loaded保留。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "pawn",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPawnData\n`PawnClass` → 实体类型。\n`AbilitySets` / 组规则 → Slot ASC。\n`MovementSet` / `InputConfig` / `DefaultCameraMode` → Pawn 组件。",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "teams",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOSquadComponent / CharacterSlot\n`SetRoster()` → 局内成员意图。\n`RegisterSlot()` → 接收生成结果。\n`InitializeForPawnData()` → 授予能力。[[Teams/结构]]",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "avatar",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCharacterBase / PawnExtension\n生成 Pawn 后调用 `SetPawnData()`、`AttachAvatar()` / `InitializeAbilitySystem()` 建立 Owner/Avatar；[[Character/结构]]。",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "asset",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAssetManager\n项目级共享资产入口；具体资产就绪与兜底约束见 [[模块参考]]。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 195,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 当前GF请求、装配资格与责任边界\nInitGame→有效Experience.TryBuildGameFeatureInput；失败拒绝，成功两空才显式NoGF。\n非空TryCreate(原World,Label,Error)→先保存GameFeatureSession再Start；完成可同步，观察者弱绑原GameMode／World／Session。\nAreGameFeaturesReady／CanAssembleForGameFeatureContext→原World／实际AuthGM／GI当前World／同Session／调用方开放；非空再读当前IsReadyFor。\nSpawnSquadForPendingPlayers→当前Controller局部弱快照；HandleStartingNewPlayer同资格；每次外部Spawn前后重核，失效停止派发。\nDestroyed／EndPlay在Super前共用CloseGameFeatureSession：封闭／清NoGF→移出原Session→Close；无第二资源、不撤GI Loaded。\n三Spawn内部仍借用登记、部分失败与创建责任未迁移。C15拒绝Borrowed，来源资产／真实插件／PIE Action隔离／网络未验。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1270,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "loaded-policy-target",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 只停用、不卸载｜整体生产目标未完成\n同一GI正常运行／切图／回菜单保原生Loaded。\n对局仅撤自己的Active；只剩Loaded时原生停用，更高需求仍可Active。\nGI结束撤自身持有；原Session真实pending／Active收尾后归还租期，最后owner才释放Loaded。\n不承诺PIE停止后永不卸载；共享插件状态不证明World Action隔离。\n仅实际GF内容；Kevin／Camera／GAS未因此插件化。\n[[计划_GameFeature|实施状态与边界]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1690,
      "width": 710,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "retention-candidate",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOGameFeatureSubsystem／ordinary owner\nGI collection→Initialize→唯一owner／原Retention。\nPrepareManagedLoadedClosure(World,Input,Completion)→全Managed闭包／真实Loaded／原租期。\nExperience成功值经GameMode保存／Start原Session后传入；GM不直接Prepare／释放GI。\n正常同步policy窗口；AssetManager启动尝试完成不是Ready缓存。\nDeinitialize关准入并撤GI持有；最后租期归还才释放。\nGate57已编译，GF正式运行未验；Borrowed拒绝／C15开放。\n[[GameFeature/结构#GI薄宿主与原World租期（09-G2：已编码，未编译）|接口]]",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 1690,
      "width": 710,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "loaded-retention-core",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOGameFeatureRetention｜Gate57已编译\n历史Gate55失败，交回时未成功整链编译、未UE冒烟；现GF正式运行未验。\n同一原生Loaded handle；ThreadSafe只保内存，API游戏线程。\nTryCreate(Label,Error)→InitAndRegister(None)。\nLoadAndRetainValidatedManagedClosure(URLs,Completion)→全闭包逐URL真实Load，先登记pending；实际回调／native返回／Loaded状态才成功。\nRetainAlreadyLoaded→仅登记，Submitted非ack。\nReleaseOwnedReferences→先closing，停止未发Load、排空已发真实回调，再ReleaseAndUnregister。\n原生成功＋调用返回＋handle失效才Released；失败不伪装成功。\n[[GameFeature/结构#Loaded 资源核心：提交与精确释放|接口与机制]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2240,
      "width": 710,
      "height": 610,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "closure-resolver-core",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOGameFeatureClosureResolver｜历史已编译，GI已有调用\n`ResolveClosureAndDeclaredSources(Subsystem, CurrentPolicy, Input)` → 仅自有FResult候选；无实例、GetPolicy或ready缓存。\n`FInput` → roots＋每个reached GFP的Managed/Borrowed声明；借用Label不证明保护。\n调用方先证明整个同步policy窗口；只支持实际默认policy、稳定installed/mapped file GFP。\n原始JSON／Projects／native Details交叉；全部enabled依赖经ResolvePluginDependency，包括非Activate。\n冲突/循环/缺声明/optional解析失败拒绝，无部分候选；成功空URL须证明非GFP。\n`ResolvedCandidate` → nodes/edges/非GFP证据/待保护借用名单；不是Loaded、所有权或释放权限，不能直接授权Retention。\n[[GameFeature/结构#受限闭包解析：候选，不是权限|范围与调用门禁]]",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 2240,
      "width": 710,
      "height": 610,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "native-core-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UE原生｜唯一插件状态、引用合并与迁移权威\nRetention→同handle真实逐URL Load／登记Loaded／ReleaseAndUnregister。\nSession→一个None Active GUID，全请求平铺Active→真实根激活→当前全集合Active核对；只释放自身GUID。\nResolver只同步读当前policy／Details；GI／Session共享持有仅保自身资源。GameMode仅原Session请求者和当前资格消费者，无插件计数／第二调度器。\nGameMode外层源码已接；Teams内部创建、C15 Borrowed保护、来源资产／插件运行／PIE Action隔离／网络未完成。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2950,
      "width": 1510,
      "height": 285,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "gf-loaded-original-lease",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOGameFeatureLoadedLease\n强持原ordinary owner、弱原World；不持GI UObject。\nGetRootPluginURLs→原根；GetActivationPluginURLs→根＋true可达URL。\n私有不可变view，使用保活租期；false-only仍Loaded，值非Active状态／权限。\nIsAdmissionOpenFor(World)→原World／GI准入。\nGameMode保存的原Session消费两view至自身收尾；GM Close不撤GI Loaded。\n[[GameFeature/结构#不可变激活请求URL（09-G4-0：源码冻结，未生产消费）|接口与算法]]",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 1690,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "gf-experience-source-values",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 630,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## Experience来源数据与转换｜09-G3\nFGGYGOGameFeatureSourceDeclaration：PluginName、Source、ExternalOwnerLabel。\nUnspecified无效；Managed必须空Label；Borrow须有效Label但不授保护。\nTryBuildGameFeatureInput(OutInput,OutErrors)→纯复制根／来源为FInput；全部合法才交值，失败清空并定位Experience／字段／原索引。\nInitGame与IsDataValid实际共用；GameMode先确认true，成功两空才NoGF，非空保存原Session再Start。\n无默认Managed；完整闭包／URL由GI／Resolver校验。来源资产未迁移，Borrowed仍拒绝、C15未关闭。\n[[GameFeature/结构#Experience显式来源配置（09-G3：已编码，未编译）|配置合同]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "gf-original-active-session",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 2240,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 650,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## FGGYGOGameFeatureSession｜原Active资源\n普通C++共享资源；弱原World／GI、强原Loaded租期；GT操作，ThreadSafe只保内存。\nTryCreate(World,Label,Error)→完整Session或空＋错误；GameMode先保存再Start。\nStart(非空成功FInput,弱观察者)→原GI真实Loaded，再消费两URL view。\n一个None Active GUID→全请求登记Active(false)→逐根真实Controller激活；无裸API。\nReady需真实全成功、GI／dispatch返回、pending空、全集合当前Active及原准入；失败保原错误并自身收尾。\nIsReadyFor(World)→同原World当前资格、直接读native；GameMode另核AuthGM／GI／同Session，不把通知当权限。\nClose→封闭／撤观察者／停止未发→真实排空→自身release门禁→归还租期。\nGameMode Destroyed／EndPlay先移出原Session并Close、先于Super；不撤GI Loaded。\nTeams内部创建／资产未迁移；新增消费者Gate57已编译，GF正式运行未验。\n[[GameFeature/结构#原World Active会话（09-G4-1：源码冻结，未生产接线）|API与清理]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "gf-detached-active-cleanup",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1620,
      "y": 3010,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 490,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## FDetachedActiveCleanup｜析构资源接管\nSession析构移出同一handle＋原租期。\n独立共享清理记录，无Session AsShared、裸this或World／GI捕获。\nGT执行；异常非GT只借Core已有队列一次投递。\n真实release callback＋调用返回＋GUID失效＋守卫保持→归还租期。\ntrue成功；正常守卫下false记录失败后归还已撤引用的租期。\n原生不可用／守卫丢失／未确认失效GUID／丢回调→诊断并自持保留，可到进程结束。\n未确认不伪造成功；不是插件状态权威或新调度器。\n[[GameFeature/结构#关闭、租期归还与独立清理|收尾边界]]"
    }
  ],
